## Generated
## (`/build/`, above, holds every generated artifact: the cppwinrt projections
## under gen/sdk + gen/winui, the combined winmd, the XamlCompiler output under
## gen/xaml, and the .xbf files deployed next to the exe. None of it is source.)
Generated Files/
*.g.h
*.g.cpp
## Scratch directory git filter-branch creates; harmless if it ever gets left behind.
.git-rewrite/

## Local data
*.tmp

## Online-source adapters: user data, never committed.
## Real adapters live in %LOCALAPPDATA%\w-music\providers (or WMUSIC_PROVIDER_DIR).
## Anything dropped in adapters/ is loaded at runtime but stays out of git.
adapters/*
!adapters/README.md
!adapters/template.json.example
!adapters/jamendo.json.example

## Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

## Agent/tool working state (local machine only -- contains absolute paths).
## Kept on disk and out of git; see .workbuddy/memory/ for the build notes.
.workbuddy/
